WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.669 --> 00:00:06.720
Speaker 1: One of the notable people who does
not want an investigation into just what on

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:13.450
earth happened in Washington, D.C. on January
6th as Trump supporters broke into the Capitol,

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:16.750
is Fox News propagandist Tucker Carlson.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.320
It's all as much of a riot as you can imagine.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:26.330
We already discussed earlier in the show that
many in the Republican Party, including Republican

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:32.369
leaders like House Minority Leader Kevin McCarthy,
they don't want the January 6th investigation

00:00:32.369 --> 00:00:34.739
to happen.

00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:41.309
And here, Tucker Carlson praises Kevin McCarthy
for opposing the investigation.

00:00:41.309 --> 00:00:44.500
Recall that Tucker Carlson is very much a
man of the people.

00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:45.500
He's a populist.

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.670
He's for transparency, for accountability.

00:00:47.670 --> 00:00:49.449
He's for all of that stuff.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:52.359
But he doesn't even want an investigation
to take place.

00:00:52.359 --> 00:00:54.999
And here he is at a Boeing, Kevin McCarthy.

00:00:54.999 --> 00:00:57.440
Speaker 2: This is not a partizan show.

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.600
We usually go after Democrats.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.309
Sometimes we go after Republicans.

00:01:00.309 --> 00:01:04.879
Recently went after a couple of times the
head Republican in the House of Representatives,

00:01:04.879 --> 00:01:07.469
Kevin McCarthy of California, for his living
arrangements.

00:01:07.469 --> 00:01:09.619
But we want to be honest above all.

00:01:09.619 --> 00:01:13.509
And when politicians do something right, we
want to say so.

00:01:13.509 --> 00:01:16.770
Kevin McCarthy, the minority leader in the
House today, did something right and said

00:01:16.770 --> 00:01:22.979
he will not support a commission, a 9/11 style
commission to investigate the insurrection

00:01:22.979 --> 00:01:23.979
of January six.

00:01:23.979 --> 00:01:31.040
Speaker 1: Tucker is defiantly proud of Kevin
McCarthy for opposing a commission to investigate

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.999
the January 6th insurrection.

00:01:32.999 --> 00:01:37.079
It's also hilarious to hear Tucker say he
doesn't do a partizan show.

00:01:37.079 --> 00:01:40.590
I mean, that we could do 15 minutes on that,
but we won't.

00:01:40.590 --> 00:01:47.210
Tucker is actually so opposed to an investigation
that he wants to take names of all Republicans

00:01:47.210 --> 00:01:51.909
who vote in favor of it because some do plan
to do the exact number is yet unclear.

00:01:51.909 --> 00:01:52.909
Take a listen.

00:01:52.909 --> 00:01:56.679
Speaker 2: The top Republican on the House
Homeland Security Committee is apparently

00:01:56.679 --> 00:01:59.710
pushing for this 9/11 style commission.

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:04.439
One anonymous House Republican told The Hill
that anywhere from between 30 and 50 Republicans

00:02:04.439 --> 00:02:08.319
might join CatCo in voting for this farce.

00:02:08.319 --> 00:02:09.319
What are they voting for?

00:02:09.319 --> 00:02:12.520
They're voting to give Nancy Pelosi, Chuck
Schumer and Joe Biden more power.

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:13.520
Power.

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.520
They do not deserve power.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:16.489
They did not win in November.

00:02:16.489 --> 00:02:20.690
Republican voters deserve to know the names
of every congressional Republican who votes

00:02:20.690 --> 00:02:25.000
for this farce, for the mythmaking that is
being used right now to strip you of your

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.480
constitutional rights.

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:30.060
They should know which of the representatives
is playing along with this poisonous hoax.

00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:35.390
Speaker 1: So clearly, Tucker, painting this
as some kind of partizan witch hunt when the

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:41.739
truth is that some Republicans are saying
they support the commission because it's being

00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:46.480
done in a bipartisan way, not only is there
bipartisan support for the commission, not

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:51.489
only are there bipartisan sponsors for the
commission, the plan right now would be that

00:02:51.489 --> 00:02:56.340
the commission would have 10 members, Democrats
get to appoint five.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.510
Republicans get to a point.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:02.049
Five Democrats appoint the chair and Republicans
appoint the vice chair.

00:03:02.049 --> 00:03:04.519
Remember, Democrats control the House.

00:03:04.519 --> 00:03:11.150
So the closest you can get to it being perfectly
bipartisan is five and five Democrats because

00:03:11.150 --> 00:03:15.750
they control the House, pick the chair, Republicans
get the vice chair and the commission would

00:03:15.750 --> 00:03:21.269
only be able to issue subpoenas if they're
signed off on by both the Democratic chair

00:03:21.269 --> 00:03:23.700
of the commission and the Republican vice
chair.

00:03:23.700 --> 00:03:29.250
So, you know, you couldn't even have a situation
where Democrats alone start issuing all sorts

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:30.250
of subpoenas.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:35.140
The Republican vice chair would have to be
on board with every single subpoena.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:37.540
And yet Tucker doesn't like it.

00:03:37.540 --> 00:03:43.420
Flames frames it as some kind of farce because,
God forbid, we should ever find out what really

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:45.030
happened on that.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.610
And the causes and the explanations for why
things went down the way they did.

00:03:48.610 --> 00:03:53.900
But as we said earlier, if you were complicit,
you wouldn't want to support it.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:58.909
And defendants accused in the January 6th
Trump riots have actually tried, two of them

00:03:58.909 --> 00:04:03.030
at least blaming Fox News and blaming President
Donald Trump.

00:04:03.030 --> 00:04:07.019
Neither has worked so far, but blaming Fox
News.

00:04:07.019 --> 00:04:11.680
Tucker Carlson is a part of Fox News, and
it seems pretty clear that he would be against

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:14.879
such an investigation because it can't possibly
be good for him.

00:04:14.879 --> 00:04:17.860
I'm not saying the probe would bring down
Tucker.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.420
I'm not saying it would get him to lose his
show or get him charged with a crime.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:23.220
None of that would happen.

00:04:23.220 --> 00:04:29.100
But if you're Tucker, it wouldn't be good
for more attention, especially in congressional

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:34.340
hearings, to be on the alleged role of Fox
News in fomenting the riots.

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.340
That's very clear.

00:04:35.340 --> 00:04:38.250
So it does make sense in that way that Tucker
would be opposed to it.

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:44.530
Now, on the other hand, the White House does
back a January 6th commission and really one

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:47.330
should have been formed on January 7th, may
be May of twenty.

00:04:47.330 --> 00:04:50.460
Twenty one is the best we can get at the end
of the day.

00:04:50.460 --> 00:04:53.760
If they can't get Republican leadership to
support it, I think they probably will.

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:58.750
But if they can't just go ahead without Republican
leadership, they can find Republicans who

00:04:58.750 --> 00:05:02.340
will be on the commission because there's
enough Republicans already at least 20 who

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:04.690
want to do the investigation.

00:05:04.690 --> 00:05:09.180
Some of those Republicans will participate
in good faith to try to get some answers.

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:14.020
And the Republicans that remain on the sidelines
screaming, this is a partizan witch hunt.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:17.430
I don't think they'll make much of a difference.

00:05:17.430 --> 00:05:22.280
Democrats should continue to focus on the
70 percent of the country that sees Biden

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:27.040
doing well uncovered and they say, yeah, Biden's
doing well, Unkovic, they see Biden doing

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:28.040
well on vaccination.

00:05:28.040 --> 00:05:31.220
And they say, yeah, the vaccination rollout
is going well.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:35.930
Just proceed, because I think you'll have
an equivalent 70 percent of the country that

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:39.570
