and will support doing it.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:44.870
If you disagree and if you think there's political
risk to going forward without Republicans

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:49.110
in the leadership supporting it, they've got
Republicans that will be on the commission.

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:50.110
Let me know.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.110
I don't see it as a risk.

00:05:51.110 --> 00:05:53.100
I think Democrats should move forward one
way or the other.

00:05:53.100 --> 00:07:00.040
Let me know your thoughts.

